  File "tests/rejected/loop.py", line 17
    while n:
TypeCheckError: a while loop in a checked file ends with decreases(measure, proof). The measure is a Nat worked out from the loop's variables, and the proof shows that it is smaller at the end of a pass than it was at the start: (new measure < old measure) == True. That is how the checker knows the loop ends. A for loop needs none of this.
